{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[HERROR] is a series of short horror episodes where everyday work routines collide with paranormal threats. Each episode is a unique standalone story lasting 1.5\u20132 hours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re looking at the first episode of the [HERROR] anthology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902800/extras/63b56005cec1de712ffacc1975c49716.poster.avif?t=1758270638\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902800/extras/63b56005cec1de712ffacc1975c49716.webm?t=1758270638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902800/extras/63b56005cec1de712ffacc1975c49716.mp4?t=1758270638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[HERROR] Gas Station Case</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dan Cooper, a 25-year-old night shift gas station worker in Ohio, recently laid off from a uranium plant, is trying to put his life back together. But everything changes when his friend Michael discovers a mysterious case by the lake. Soon, people begin to vanish in the surrounding woods, and the cozy gas station turns into a deadly trap.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is primarily a first-person narrative walking simulator featuring exploration, work, and dialogue mechanics, inspired by series like <i>Fears to Fathom</i> and <i>Chilla's Art</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environments and cozy visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS tape aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience working as a gas station attendant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A carefully crafted story full of small details</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional \u201cQuiet Screamer\u201d mode for players who fear jumpscares but still want to enjoy the atmosphere and story of horror</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3902800?t=1758270638","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902800/74bb4a3b05f8cc833d41203ff0b1b22b3c950ee7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758270638","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902800/fdb7dbb9f0296e927d8c0f00bd13318affa572f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758270638","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902800/fdb7dbb9f0296e927d8c0f00bd13318affa572f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758270638","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3972310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[HERROR] is a series of short horror episodes where everyday work routines collide with paranormal threats. Each episode is a unique standalone story lasting 1.5\u20132 hours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re looking at the first episode of the [HERROR] anthology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902800/extras/63b56005cec1de712ffacc1975c49716.poster.avif?t=1758270638\" width=600 height=338 >